    <briefdescription>
<para>Hierarchical <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_region_node" kindref="compound">RegionNode</ref> successor iterator. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This iterator iterates over all successors of a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_region_node" kindref="compound">RegionNode</ref>.</para>
<para>For a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_basic_block" kindref="compound">BasicBlock</ref> <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_region_node" kindref="compound">RegionNode</ref> it skips all BasicBlocks that are not part of the parent <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_region" kindref="compound">Region</ref>. Furthermore for BasicBlocks that start a subregion, a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_region_node" kindref="compound">RegionNode</ref> representing the subregion is returned.</para>
<para>For a subregion <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_region_node" kindref="compound">RegionNode</ref> there is just one successor. The <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_region_node" kindref="compound">RegionNode</ref> representing the exit of the subregion. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
